hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1449","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Ibn Adam mujhe takleef deta hai. Wo zamane ko gali deta hai, jabke main zamana hun. Mere hath mein mamla hai. Main raat aur din ko pherta hun."
"1450","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aur wo angoor ko karam kehte hain. Beshak karam momin ka dil hai."
"1451","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi na kahe: Apne rab ko khilao, apne rab ko wuzu karao, apne rab ko pilao. Aur use chahiye ke kahe: Mere sardar, mere aaqa. Aur tum mein se koi na kahe: Mera banda, meri bandi. Aur use chahiye ke kahe: Mera ladka, meri ladki aur mera ghulam."
"1452","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi hargiz na kahe: Mera dil bura ho gaya. Lekin use chahiye ke kahe: Mera dil sust ho gaya."
"1453","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Hunaif (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi hargiz na kahe: Mera dil bura ho gaya. Lekin use chahiye ke kahe: Mera dil sust ho gaya."
